Name: octavemasterpro
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-10-04
Author: Satvik Praveen
Maintainer: Satvik Praveen
Title: Verified numerical methods and evaluation tools for GNU Octave
Description: Tested implementations of numerical linear algebra (Householder
 QR, Gram-Schmidt variants, randomized SVD), quasi-Newton optimization with
 strong-Wolfe line search, resampling-based statistical inference (BCa and
 cluster bootstrap, permutation tests, multiplicity corrections, effect
 sizes), Welch spectral estimation, leakage-aware model evaluation (DeLong
 AUC, calibration, purged temporal cross-validation) and a predictive-
 maintenance simulator with known ground truth. Every function carries
 built-in tests that check results against analytic references or
 published values.
Categories: Numerical, Statistics, Machine Learning
Depends: octave (>= 6.1.0)
License: MIT
Url: https://github.com/SatvikPraveen/OctaveMasterPro
